    <unit id="ColorDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Set the color of circles. green means completed or success status, red means warning or error, and blue means ongoing or other default status, gray for unfinished or disabled status.</source>
        <target state="translated">設置圓圈顏色。綠色表示完成或成功，紅色表示警告或錯誤，藍色表示進行中或其他默認狀態，灰色表示未完成或禁用。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
